<%--
Bf_Bad - a child whose on_load() rejects. Its boot can never reach 'ready', so
the framework must STOP it: the stop event is the only thing that can release a
parent parked in _wait_for_children_ready().
--%>
<Define:Bf_Bad class="bf-bad">
  <span>never rendered with data</span>
</Define:Bf_Bad>
